  "goodToKnow": "Die Textur is texture, of food (eine cremige Textur), skin products, fabrics, surfaces and in 3D graphics. It comes from Latin texere (to weave), like Textil and Text. Native synonyms: die Beschaffenheit (consistency), die Oberfläche, die Struktur. Food writers love words like knusprig (crunchy), zart (tender) and schmelzend (melting) to describe Texturen. Plural: die Texturen."
